  the pattern exactly or justify why it cannot.

  Why this exists: without it the agent re-invents dispatch/persist/validation
  wiring from first principles each round — plausible each time, different each
  time (the Test-8 five-round bug class). One short canonical snippet per
  integration point ends that.

  Rules of thumb:
  - One `## <integration point>` section per pattern, with a SHORT canonical
    snippet copied from the real codebase (10–30 lines beats a page).
  - Patterns are per-ecosystem FACTS, not style preferences — only include what
    a reviewer would reject a deviation from.
  - The whole file is injected within a ~6000-char budget; keep it tight.
  - This .example file is NEVER read by the agent — only `agent_patterns.md` is.
