## Example — message handler registration
```java
// New inbound message types register in <YourDispatcherRegistry>, never via a
// hand-rolled if/else chain in the controller:
registry.register(MsgType.REQ_TRANSFER, new ReqTransferHandler(deps…));
```

## Example — persisting a new transaction state
```java
// State transitions go through <YourTxnStateService>.transition(…) — it owns
// the audit row + idempotency key; a direct repository.save() skips both:
txnStateService.transition(txn, TxnState.VALIDATED, auditCtx);
```
